WEBVTT

00:07:25.676 --> 00:07:30.556
(Applause)

00:07:30.556 --> 00:07:32.516
Next, we need to realize

00:07:32.556 --> 00:07:38.116
that our climate action
cannot be localized.

00:07:39.156 --> 00:07:43.196
Greenhouse gases don't hover
over any one country,

00:07:43.196 --> 00:07:46.636
emissions anywhere
means warming everywhere.

00:07:47.236 --> 00:07:49.356
So for us investors,

00:07:49.396 --> 00:07:53.516
we need to get over
our home-country biases

00:07:53.556 --> 00:07:58.716
that cause us to allocate capital
often too close to where we live.